## Interface: 20506
## Title: PixlLootCouncil
## Notes: Loot council for TBC Anniversary. The master looter collects the raid's loot, the council reviews everyone's interest in one window, and every trade is guided from there. Raiders can also answer a master looter who runs RCLootCouncil.
